  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I personally find it confusing and scary for just some random name to pop up adding you but then you have no idea who they are and they aren't even in your session\n\nSo I would like to request for a feature where people can decide to add a short comment to send with their friend request so as to help people to understand who they are or why they added them\n\nBut of course also allow us to have a button to report said comments as people. Might troll with it or use it to harass people",
